    LLM: "Prioritize winning your second consecutive trick to collect the center pile, especially if it contains a ten.\n\nThrow low cards when you know you can't win the second trick of a sequence to avoid helping opponents collect the pile.\n\nCoordinate with your partner to 'block' opponents' second wins and 'pass' the lead to your partner if they have a stronger follow-up.",
